# Maps an image repository built from this repository to the environment
# variable the trainer-operator reads it from.
#
# The integration test pipeline reports the images built for a pull request
# (see integration-tests/trainer/tasks/resolve-built-images.yaml in
# odh-konflux-central); only the repositories listed here are forwarded to the
# deployment, so an image without an entry fails the setup instead of being
# silently ignored.
#
# Keep in sync with rhoai/operator/internal/controller/params.go - the
# operator's params keys do not map one to one to repository names, e.g.
# odh-kubeflow-trainer-controller-image is fed by RELATED_IMAGE_ODH_TRAINER_IMAGE.
quay.io/opendatahub/trainer=RELATED_IMAGE_ODH_TRAINER_IMAGE
quay.io/opendatahub/odh-trainer-operator=OPERATOR_IMAGE
quay.io/opendatahub/odh-th-torch-cuda-py312=RELATED_IMAGE_ODH_TH_TORCH_CUDA_PY312_IMAGE
quay.io/opendatahub/odh-th-torch-rocm-py312=RELATED_IMAGE_ODH_TH_TORCH_ROCM_PY312_IMAGE
quay.io/opendatahub/odh-th-torch-cpu-py312=RELATED_IMAGE_ODH_TH_TORCH_CPU_PY312_IMAGE
